cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the version-specific archived release."
title: "Alpaca Pipelines: Bioacoustic Detection and Curation Workflows for Alpaca Hum Research"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ariza
    given-names: Daniel
abstract: >-
  Software for standardizing field audio collections, preparing curated
  bioacoustic datasets, training and evaluating CNN-based alpaca hum detectors,
  running inference and random-forest filtering, generating manual-review
  artifacts, postprocessing detections, and executing workflows with SLURM.
version: 0.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23599879
date-released: 2026-10-23
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/darizae/alpaca-pipelines"
url: "https://github.com/darizae/alpaca-pipelines"
